          <ferc:OtherRegulatoryLiabilityDomain>Pension and PBOP D.P.U. 03-47, 06-55 - This mechanism defers pension and PBOP costs that exceed the current rate recovery. Each year's deferred amount is amortized over the subsequent three year period.</ferc:OtherRegulatoryLiabilityDomain>
